131
00:05:13,103 --> 00:05:14,926
Five: answers dot text,

132
00:05:14,926 --> 00:05:15,877
three lines.

133
00:05:15,877 --> 00:05:17,778
Public class: file name.

134
00:05:17,778 --> 00:05:19,046
Exit code: zero.

135
00:05:19,046 --> 00:05:20,869
Java takes: class name.

136
